(1435760, 185310, 3669, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and how the grain shows up in the wood.  I like the angle at which this picture was taken.  The sky makes for a nice background.</td>', 'Love the lighting and how the grain shows up in the wood.  I like the angle at which this picture was taken.  The sky makes for a nice background.', '2005-06-06 03:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
