(1436194, 185675, 24314, '<td valign="top">brilliant pic, love it</td>', 'brilliant pic, love it', '2005-06-06 08:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436198, 185924, 14671, '<td valign="top">Altho this is a photo of a framing of a house IMO I do not think this is what they mean for this particular challenge.  I has beautiful blues and it is a very crisp photo I find the photo itself lacks interest/subject.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have made for a better photo, for example if you cropped up the bottom stair (about where you see the 5 blue marks on the plywood) and centered the crop (crop some off the right side)  would have made for a more appealing photo.  All and all I tink its the subject itself that I personally find unappealing.  It also appears that the camera was on a bit of an angle giving it an odd depth on the right side of this photo.  However I do realy like the blue sky in the background and love the way you have captured the cloud within the frame of the house.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Altho this is a photo of a framing of a house IMO I do not think this is what they mean for this particular challenge.  I has beautiful blues and it is a very crisp photo I find the photo itself lacks interest/subject.  Perhaps a tighter crop would have made for a better photo, for example if you cropped up the bottom stair (about where you see the 5 blue marks on the plywood) and centered the crop (crop some off the right side)  would have made for a more appealing photo.  All and all I tink its the subject itself that I personally find unappealing.  It also appears that the camera was on a bit of an angle giving it an odd depth on the right side of this photo.  However I do realy like the blue sky in the background and love the way you have captured the cloud within the frame of the house.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 08:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436200, 185945, 36006, '<td valign="top">blacks good, whites not pure, nice lines, meets criteria but the frame is on his torso the crop does not count, nice comp, nice dof, overall nice</td>', 'blacks good, whites not pure, nice lines, meets criteria but the frame is on his torso the crop does not count, nice comp, nice dof, overall nice', '2005-06-06 08:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436203, 184245, 36006, '<td valign="top">whites good, blacks barely in, nice thought, nice texture, nice color, maybe a bit soft but not bad, maybe a bit blown but not bad, color ok</td>', 'whites good, blacks barely in, nice thought, nice texture, nice color, maybe a bit soft but not bad, maybe a bit blown but not bad, color ok', '2005-06-06 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436206, 185779, 36006, '<td valign="top">I''ve got to ask, wasn''t this done before but in a differant challenge? Looks familiar. Nice b&amp;w''s, nice light, nice lines, nice overall</td>', 'I''ve got to ask, wasn''t this done before but in a differant challenge? Looks familiar. Nice b&w''s, nice light, nice lines, nice overall', '2005-06-06 09:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436207, 184392, 14671, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if its the contrast or the soft focus I don''t like but one of the 2 is bugging me.  It makes the photo appear to be blurry which can naturally happen when shooting wood.  It may also be color balance.  As for the subject IMO wagon wheels have been over done on this site altho it does fit the challenge.  Perhaps a sharpening thru photo shop and playing with the color levels would have improved this shot a bit.  I also would have liked to seen the sides cropped more to bring the attention to the wheel  and not the wood thats framing it.  Perhaps a B&amp;W conversion and contrast adjustment would have also made a difference in this photo.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I don''t know if its the contrast or the soft focus I don''t like but one of the 2 is bugging me.  It makes the photo appear to be blurry which can naturally happen when shooting wood.  It may also be color balance.  As for the subject IMO wagon wheels have been over done on this site altho it does fit the challenge.  Perhaps a sharpening thru photo shop and playing with the color levels would have improved this shot a bit.  I also would have liked to seen the sides cropped more to bring the attention to the wheel  and not the wood thats framing it.  Perhaps a B&W conversion and contrast adjustment would have also made a difference in this photo.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436209, 185728, 36006, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, blacks good, whites good, color good, dof good, nice comp, nice idea</td>', 'nice lighting, blacks good, whites good, color good, dof good, nice comp, nice idea', '2005-06-06 09:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436214, 183852, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.. I hope this place is close because I want to go there!</td>', 'Beautiful.. I hope this place is close because I want to go there!', '2005-06-06 09:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436216, 184981, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but one that I feel would benefit from a bump up on the colors and contrasts. The slight blow on the foreground leaves are also competing for viewers'' attention with the water flow. 6</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but one that I feel would benefit from a bump up on the colors and contrasts. The slight blow on the foreground leaves are also competing for viewers'' attention with the water flow. 6', '2005-06-06 09:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436217, 185743, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment. I do think the signets look a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice sentiment. I do think the signets look a bit soft.', '2005-06-06 09:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436220, 186009, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Polarizer use perhaps would have been effective here in taking out the reflective water and producing a subtler backdrop for the frog. Nice sharpness, though. 6</td>', 'Nice catch. Polarizer use perhaps would have been effective here in taking out the reflective water and producing a subtler backdrop for the frog. Nice sharpness, though. 6', '2005-06-06 09:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436221, 185995, 14671, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot with excellent colors but I find the photo appears to be a little to over-sharpened.  Perhaps its pollin (and could very well be) but I find it to be distracting.  If I sit back a bit further from the monitor it clears up a bit which is why I said it could be pollin.  For the most part the photo is very well done and well centered.  I do love the clarity of the pedals and it looks just as it would feel if you were holding it in your hand.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A beautiful shot with excellent colors but I find the photo appears to be a little to over-sharpened.  Perhaps its pollin (and could very well be) but I find it to be distracting.  If I sit back a bit further from the monitor it clears up a bit which is why I said it could be pollin.  For the most part the photo is very well done and well centered.  I do love the clarity of the pedals and it looks just as it would feel if you were holding it in your hand.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. <8>', '2005-06-06 09:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436222, 185816, 37851, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful kitty.</td>', 'What a beautiful kitty.', '2005-06-06 09:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436225, 186044, 34247, '<td valign="top">The bumped up greens are quite jarring to my eyes, and overall, there''s a lot of competition here for the image''s focus point (as in a lot of distractions and my eyes don''t immediately settle on the turkey. There also seems to be a slight blur, as if the turkey was in motion, that could have necessitated the use of faster shutter, etc. Why not bigger aperture and deeper bokeh? Nice turkey, though. Yumm...</td>', 'The bumped up greens are quite jarring to my eyes, and overall, there''s a lot of competition here for the image''s focus point (as in a lot of distractions and my eyes don''t immediately settle on the turkey. There also seems to be a slight blur, as if the turkey was in motion, that could have necessitated the use of faster shutter, etc. Why not bigger aperture and deeper bokeh? Nice turkey, though. Yumm...', '2005-06-06 09:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436226, 186062, 36199, '<td valign="top">lovely picture i am used to seeing this subject in vivid colour - but i think it works very well in black and white.</td>', 'lovely picture i am used to seeing this subject in vivid colour - but i think it works very well in black and white.', '2005-06-06 09:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436227, 185479, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, and as the shot was loading up slowly, a thought flashed through my head: What if the snake was constricting another animal, thereby frame within a frame? A tad sharper focus on the snake would have yielded a more effective image, imho. Nice colors on the leaves. 7</td>', 'Nice framing, and as the shot was loading up slowly, a thought flashed through my head: What if the snake was constricting another animal, thereby frame within a frame? A tad sharper focus on the snake would have yielded a more effective image, imho. Nice colors on the leaves. 7', '2005-06-06 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436231, 185454, 34247, '<td valign="top">Eye-popper thumbnail, nice colors on the image.</td>', 'Eye-popper thumbnail, nice colors on the image.', '2005-06-06 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436233, 185136, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the subject at all.  I find it gives a "last minute" feel to your entry.  I do like the clarity and the B&amp;W conversion but really cannot get past the subject.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m not fond of the subject at all.  I find it gives a "last minute" feel to your entry.  I do like the clarity and the B&W conversion but really cannot get past the subject.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 09:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436236, 185735, 34247, '<td valign="top">The blown sky isn''t working for me, but I like the composition very much. Perhaps a crop out of the top third, reducing the sky and emphasizing the nice curve of the road would work well. The grain is nice, particularly on the road surfaces.</td>', 'The blown sky isn''t working for me, but I like the composition very much. Perhaps a crop out of the top third, reducing the sky and emphasizing the nice curve of the road would work well. The grain is nice, particularly on the road surfaces.', '2005-06-06 09:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436237, 185642, 36888, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo-7</td>', 'Really like this photo-7', '2005-06-06 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436238, 185321, 34247, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and a nice use of the green as a framing component. Highlights the yellow very well, and the sharpness is great. at least an 8 with potential bump later.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and a nice use of the green as a framing component. Highlights the yellow very well, and the sharpness is great. at least an 8 with potential bump later.', '2005-06-06 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436241, 185952, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and light, but I feel the reddish/sepia toning isn''t quite working. Purer black and white, with a bit more emphasis on contrasts would have been very effective for me, I think. 7 for the available textures and posing.</td>', 'Nice composition and light, but I feel the reddish/sepia toning isn''t quite working. Purer black and white, with a bit more emphasis on contrasts would have been very effective for me, I think. 7 for the available textures and posing.', '2005-06-06 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436242, 185704, 14671, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Altho the curvse and circles do very litle for my tastes I find the photo to fit the challenge really well and puts a natural abstract feeling to the photo which in my opinion raises the bar for this challenge.  I like the colors, clarity and focus involved with this photo and think it wil do very well dispite me not liking the photo itself.  Again just my taste and is a very well thought out and well planned photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;<br/> <br/>BTW: my tastes have very little to do with how I vote.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Altho the curvse and circles do very litle for my tastes I find the photo to fit the challenge really well and puts a natural abstract feeling to the photo which in my opinion raises the bar for this challenge.  I like the colors, clarity and focus involved with this photo and think it wil do very well dispite me not liking the photo itself.  Again just my taste and is a very well thought out and well planned photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9> BTW: my tastes have very little to do with how I vote.', '2005-06-06 09:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436243, 185858, 34247, '<td valign="top">This focus here feels too soft, and the low-contrast toning is not effective for me. It''s also one of those images where I scream a bit for a more definitive focus object (what you''d want me to focus on when I look at the image).</td>', 'This focus here feels too soft, and the low-contrast toning is not effective for me. It''s also one of those images where I scream a bit for a more definitive focus object (what you''d want me to focus on when I look at the image).', '2005-06-06 09:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436244, 185917, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice composition, and one that I think would benefit quite a lot from less depth of field/greater bokeh.</td>', 'It''s a nice composition, and one that I think would benefit quite a lot from less depth of field/greater bokeh.', '2005-06-06 09:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436251, 185264, 14671, '<td valign="top">I am not fond of the subject or the framing in this particular photo.  I find the subject to be lacking interest and to contraversial for a challenge.  I also find that there is only a partial frame but you will not get marked down for that.  I find the photo has to much contrast from the sky and giving the building a fuzzy/soft focus look which I find unnecessary and very distracting.  I also find that you may have a clarity issue with the tree leaves which may or may not be corrected by a slight levels adjustment or color adjustment.  However dispite my personal views on the building I find that this could have made for a nicer shot(for this particular building) if the sky was blue or stormy grey and a little more focused.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I am not fond of the subject or the framing in this particular photo.  I find the subject to be lacking interest and to contraversial for a challenge.  I also find that there is only a partial frame but you will not get marked down for that.  I find the photo has to much contrast from the sky and giving the building a fuzzy/soft focus look which I find unnecessary and very distracting.  I also find that you may have a clarity issue with the tree leaves which may or may not be corrected by a slight levels adjustment or color adjustment.  However dispite my personal views on the building I find that this could have made for a nicer shot(for this particular building) if the sky was blue or stormy grey and a little more focused.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-06-06 09:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436255, 185753, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very disappointing to me that the top of the arch is cut off. Otherwise I really like this!</td>', 'Very disappointing to me that the top of the arch is cut off. Otherwise I really like this!', '2005-06-06 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436257, 185087, 35645, '<td valign="top">Really cool lighting! Love the detail in the stones. Kind of pulls you in past the trees.</td>', 'Really cool lighting! Love the detail in the stones. Kind of pulls you in past the trees.', '2005-06-06 09:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436260, 185704, 35645, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, but the crop is a little tight for me - the bottome edge of the circle is barely cut off, but it''s enough to stick out &amp; annoy.</td>', 'Really cool shot, but the crop is a little tight for me - the bottome edge of the circle is barely cut off, but it''s enough to stick out & annoy.', '2005-06-06 09:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436263, 184245, 14671, '<td valign="top">Altho this photo may fit the challenge I feel it would have done better in a window or portrait challenge.  The subject is not the greatest subject as it is just a person and the frame altho is very interesting is a little more interesting the the person behind it .  I think the photo has excellent clarity, color and crispness and for the most part is well put together but IMO the subject lacks.  I title such as "looking for my baseball" might have a greater impact to go along with this photo.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Altho this photo may fit the challenge I feel it would have done better in a window or portrait challenge.  The subject is not the greatest subject as it is just a person and the frame altho is very interesting is a little more interesting the the person behind it .  I think the photo has excellent clarity, color and crispness and for the most part is well put together but IMO the subject lacks.  I title such as "looking for my baseball" might have a greater impact to go along with this photo.   Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-06-06 09:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436264, 183747, 37295, '<td valign="top">Excellent- very apt for the title, Good Luck! - My score 9</td>', 'Excellent- very apt for the title, Good Luck! - My score 9', '2005-06-06 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436267, 185787, 35645, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Am assuming this is not a put-up job. ;)<br/>I love the colors here - feels very fresh and spring-like. The people in the background seem like intruders into the picture. Would have liked to see a bit more of the hillside in the background, especially if you could have gotten the crest of the hill in the pic. As it stands now, there''s just enough horizon to make me feel a bit tilted. Alternatively, a tighter crop with the little bit of sky removed would also work, IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting. Am assuming this is not a put-up job. ;)I love the colors here - feels very fresh and spring-like. The people in the background seem like intruders into the picture. Would have liked to see a bit more of the hillside in the background, especially if you could have gotten the crest of the hill in the pic. As it stands now, there''s just enough horizon to make me feel a bit tilted. Alternatively, a tighter crop with the little bit of sky removed would also work, IMHO.', '2005-06-06 09:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436269, 185871, 33361, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this couldn''t win...it''s fabulous! 10</td>', 'I don''t see how this couldn''t win...it''s fabulous! 10', '2005-06-06 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436271, 186045, 33361, '<td valign="top">very interesting abstract...would have cloned the yellow area on cement 7</td>', 'very interesting abstract...would have cloned the yellow area on cement 7', '2005-06-06 09:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436278, 185777, 33361, '<td valign="top">think this would have been more effective without the woman 6</td>', 'think this would have been more effective without the woman 6', '2005-06-06 09:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436280, 185732, 16241, '<td valign="top">good [and cute]</td>', 'good [and cute]', '2005-06-06 09:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436281, 185690, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the shot because the subject is not really framed altho its is by DoF which is debatable.  Aside from that I find the clarity of the ducks appear to be a tad over sharpened which takes away from the beauty.  I am also not fond of the DOF of the leaves and find it takes away more then it adds to this photo which is why I''m not fond of it.  I think you did a great job not getting any hot spots off the water tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I''m not fond of the shot because the subject is not really framed altho its is by DoF which is debatable.  Aside from that I find the clarity of the ducks appear to be a tad over sharpened which takes away from the beauty.  I am also not fond of the DOF of the leaves and find it takes away more then it adds to this photo which is why I''m not fond of it.  I think you did a great job not getting any hot spots off the water tho.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 09:42:01.000000', NULL, 1);
