(1436296, 185013, 33672, '<td valign="top">Crisp, exciting and colorful! One of my top scorers!</td>', 'Crisp, exciting and colorful! One of my top scorers!', '2005-06-06 09:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436297, 186043, 36888, '<td valign="top">Like the photo, may have cropped the left hand side a little more.</td>', 'Like the photo, may have cropped the left hand side a little more.', '2005-06-06 09:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436303, 184167, 33361, '<td valign="top">love this! 9</td>', 'love this! 9', '2005-06-06 09:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436304, 185840, 33672, '<td valign="top">And my photos... Maybe some old sketches      ;)</td>', 'And my photos... Maybe some old sketches      ;)', '2005-06-06 09:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436305, 185326, 14671, '<td valign="top">Wow very interesting.  Am I outside looking in at a reflection or inside looking out.  Very nicely done on the abastract side of photography.  I really like the reflection and the colors and clarity of the shot but and not really fond of the subject, not that I will be voting down your subject in this photo because I feel all in all it was very well thought out and should take a ribbon.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Wow very interesting.  Am I outside looking in at a reflection or inside looking out.  Very nicely done on the abastract side of photography.  I really like the reflection and the colors and clarity of the shot but and not really fond of the subject, not that I will be voting down your subject in this photo because I feel all in all it was very well thought out and should take a ribbon.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <9>', '2005-06-06 09:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436306, 185797, 34194, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot but is this really a fit for this challenge?</td>', 'Very cool shot but is this really a fit for this challenge?', '2005-06-06 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436307, 185931, 38639, '<td valign="top">I love it!!!! Doesn''t it make you mad that people actually hunt these animals?<br/>And it is naturally framed!</td>', 'I love it!!!! Doesn''t it make you mad that people actually hunt these animals?And it is naturally framed!', '2005-06-06 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436309, 185979, 34194, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a ribbon winner....</td>', 'Looks to be a ribbon winner....', '2005-06-06 09:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436310, 185997, 34194, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus?</td>', 'A little out of focus?', '2005-06-06 09:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436312, 185634, 14671, '<td valign="top">I find the photo as beautiful as it is has some serious focus issues. It also looks like it has to much contrast as well.  I do however like the colors involed and wish they were a little more vibrant.  Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'I find the photo as beautiful as it is has some serious focus issues. It also looks like it has to much contrast as well.  I do however like the colors involed and wish they were a little more vibrant.  Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 09:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436317, 185822, 33672, '<td valign="top">Crisp silhouette and background would''ve rated a 10! Original and great comp, not to mention negative space. I like it!</td>', 'Crisp silhouette and background would''ve rated a 10! Original and great comp, not to mention negative space. I like it!', '2005-06-06 09:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436318, 186048, 33361, '<td valign="top">would love to see this in black and white! 7</td>', 'would love to see this in black and white! 7', '2005-06-06 09:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436319, 185880, 33361, '<td valign="top">wow! interesting! 9</td>', 'wow! interesting! 9', '2005-06-06 09:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436321, 184981, 34194, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems very flat.</td>', 'Lighting seems very flat.', '2005-06-06 09:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436322, 185985, 33361, '<td valign="top">would crop some off the top...too long 7</td>', 'would crop some off the top...too long 7', '2005-06-06 09:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436323, 185901, 14671, '<td valign="top">The photo is not level.  I also find it to be a little OoF but do think it would have made for a nice photo.  I like the way it looks rainy/wet and find it gives character to the photo.  A rotation of 1 to 2 degrees CCW nd recrop would have made for a more level and apealing photo.  I really like that wet look overall.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'The photo is not level.  I also find it to be a little OoF but do think it would have made for a nice photo.  I like the way it looks rainy/wet and find it gives character to the photo.  A rotation of 1 to 2 degrees CCW nd recrop would have made for a more level and apealing photo.  I really like that wet look overall.  Good luck in this challenge. <5>', '2005-06-06 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436324, 183964, 34194, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2005-06-06 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436327, 185184, 34194, '<td valign="top">The highlights are too washed out, otherwise interesting shot.</td>', 'The highlights are too washed out, otherwise interesting shot.', '2005-06-06 10:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436330, 185383, 33361, '<td valign="top">set up is cute and baby is adorable but I am looking at who caught something that is "naturally" framed...sorry</td>', 'set up is cute and baby is adorable but I am looking at who caught something that is "naturally" framed...sorry', '2005-06-06 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436334, 185102, 38670, '<td valign="top">Wow i really like this picture. and that sentence that we all know and love. lol. the colors are really cool too. great  job.</td>', 'Wow i really like this picture. and that sentence that we all know and love. lol. the colors are really cool too. great  job.', '2005-06-06 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436337, 185976, 14671, '<td valign="top">A subject framed by itself.  Interesting.  Excellent clarity and color but the subject vs. the frame in a little to close IMO.  The photo has a general pleasing feel to it and I think it is an excellent wildlife photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A subject framed by itself.  Interesting.  Excellent clarity and color but the subject vs. the frame in a little to close IMO.  The photo has a general pleasing feel to it and I think it is an excellent wildlife photo.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <8>', '2005-06-06 10:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436339, 185597, 35720, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and well framed, but a bit too oversaturated and oversharpened IMHO.</td>', 'Very nice shot and well framed, but a bit too oversaturated and oversharpened IMHO.', '2005-06-06 10:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436343, 183843, 14671, '<td valign="top">excellent clarity and the lack of color without going B&amp;W is very impressive.  Altho I am not fond of the subject or frame in this picture it does meet the challenge, was well thought out, is well composed, is a very crisp and a very clear image.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'excellent clarity and the lack of color without going B&W is very impressive.  Altho I am not fond of the subject or frame in this picture it does meet the challenge, was well thought out, is well composed, is a very crisp and a very clear image.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.  <7>', '2005-06-06 10:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436347, 185728, 14671, '<td valign="top">The people standing at the top of the ramp are very distracting and would have made for a better photo if they were not in it.  The photo itself is pretty boring but does meet the challenge.  I find that the photo has a little to much contrast/brightness but with the direction of the sun draws the eyes into the photo. Good luck in this challenge.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'The people standing at the top of the ramp are very distracting and would have made for a better photo if they were not in it.  The photo itself is pretty boring but does meet the challenge.  I find that the photo has a little to much contrast/brightness but with the direction of the sun draws the eyes into the photo. Good luck in this challenge.  <5>', '2005-06-06 10:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1436369, 185275, 14671, '<td valign="top">Naturally framed and framed by nature are 2 different things IMO but both fit for this challenge.  IMO you have to much frame and not enought subject.  Perhaps a tigher crop  would have made for a more cosmetically pleasing photo without putting the emphasis on the frame.  Good luck in this challenge. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Naturally framed and framed by nature are 2 different things IMO but both fit for this challenge.  IMO you have to much frame and not enought subject.  Perhaps a tigher crop  would have made for a more cosmetically pleasing photo without putting the emphasis on the frame.  Good luck in this challenge. <6>', '2005-06-06 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
