(1437692, 186037, 35645, '<td valign="top">I think that a tighter crop (leaving out much of the sky and all of the building) would make this a stronger picture. As it stands now, I almost don''t know where to look - almost as if the man/dog silhouette were an afterthought rather than the main subject.</td>', 'I think that a tighter crop (leaving out much of the sky and all of the building) would make this a stronger picture. As it stands now, I almost don''t know where to look - almost as if the man/dog silhouette were an afterthought rather than the main subject.', '2005-06-06 20:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1437696, 186065, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait. Very lively and full of energy and enthusiasm. Gorgeous color. I only wish I could see the top of the roach.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait. Very lively and full of energy and enthusiasm. Gorgeous color. I only wish I could see the top of the roach.', '2005-06-06 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1437706, 185797, 35645, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, would give it a 9 but I can''t make out how this fits the challenge. The subjects are the skyline and clouds, neither of which frame the other, IMO. There does not seem to be any other subject, and the only thing I see that could be construed as a frame is the border that''s been added. I do love the texture in the clouds, and the color gives it a very moody, ''heavy'', foreboding feel. Sigh. 7 for this one.</td>', 'I love this picture, would give it a 9 but I can''t make out how this fits the challenge. The subjects are the skyline and clouds, neither of which frame the other, IMO. There does not seem to be any other subject, and the only thing I see that could be construed as a frame is the border that''s been added. I do love the texture in the clouds, and the color gives it a very moody, ''heavy'', foreboding feel. Sigh. 7 for this one.', '2005-06-06 20:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1437708, 186040, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, and the soft focus gives it a very dreamy feel. A very pleasant and relaxing photo.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, and the soft focus gives it a very dreamy feel. A very pleasant and relaxing photo.', '2005-06-06 20:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
