(1437791, 185037, 31230, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I love the b/w treament here and the added grain really gives this shot a rustic feel.</td>', 'Very cool, I love the b/w treament here and the added grain really gives this shot a rustic feel.', '2005-06-06 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
