(1439599, 184167, 3214, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Early evening?</td>', 'Well done!  Early evening?', '2005-06-07 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439618, 185704, 37719, '<td valign="top">I only wish the boat was larger...10 though since it is quite unique.  Good eye!</td>', 'I only wish the boat was larger...10 though since it is quite unique.  Good eye!', '2005-06-07 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439619, 185135, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!  Such a find indeed!</td>', 'This is a great photo!  Such a find indeed!', '2005-06-07 22:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439622, 185753, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Nice composition and great perspective!</td>', 'Very well done!  Nice composition and great perspective!', '2005-06-07 22:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439626, 185751, 37719, '<td valign="top">I am jealous!  Very nice photo!  One of my favorite subjects is trains and tracks/crossings/bridges and have yet to find a location like this with such character.  Great job!<br/></td>', 'I am jealous!  Very nice photo!  One of my favorite subjects is trains and tracks/crossings/bridges and have yet to find a location like this with such character.  Great job!', '2005-06-07 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439628, 185413, 37719, '<td valign="top">Vey unique and a great photo!  I love the angle of the shot and the growth at the base - how one shows and the other doesn''t.  Very nice work!</td>', 'Vey unique and a great photo!  I love the angle of the shot and the growth at the base - how one shows and the other doesn''t.  Very nice work!', '2005-06-07 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439635, 186037, 37719, '<td valign="top">Always strange to see somewhere you have been many times in a photo from someone else.  Great shot!  The contrast between the two areas really captures the feeling of being ''right there.''</td>', 'Always strange to see somewhere you have been many times in a photo from someone else.  Great shot!  The contrast between the two areas really captures the feeling of being ''right there.''', '2005-06-07 23:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439637, 185625, 37719, '<td valign="top">Very original and really imaginative shot!  Nice capture and really nice work.  Well done!</td>', 'Very original and really imaginative shot!  Nice capture and really nice work.  Well done!', '2005-06-07 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439695, 185586, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and great capture of the juxtaposition of his outfit and the weary expression on his face (especially remarkable given that his hat is shading part of his face).  This photo is framed beautifully in green and blue shades.  Nice work all around.  I love rodeos and this is a memorable moment.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and great capture of the juxtaposition of his outfit and the weary expression on his face (especially remarkable given that his hat is shading part of his face).  This photo is framed beautifully in green and blue shades.  Nice work all around.  I love rodeos and this is a memorable moment.', '2005-06-07 23:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439704, 185789, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice example of a photo where both the object framing (the treen trunk) and the object it frames are equally enthralling.  The sky is a little dark for me taste, it looks too artifical.</td>', 'Nice example of a photo where both the object framing (the treen trunk) and the object it frames are equally enthralling.  The sky is a little dark for me taste, it looks too artifical.', '2005-06-07 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439712, 185413, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great entry for this challenge.  The symmetry works really nicely in this photo.  I would maybe like to see a bit more saturation.  Very serene and beautiful.</td>', 'Great entry for this challenge.  The symmetry works really nicely in this photo.  I would maybe like to see a bit more saturation.  Very serene and beautiful.', '2005-06-07 23:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439721, 185753, 37103, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is so powerful here.  I''m amazed you captured so much detail in the stones and the clouds way in the distance.  I especially love the cobblestones up front.  Great work all around.</td>', 'The depth of field is so powerful here.  I''m amazed you captured so much detail in the stones and the clouds way in the distance.  I especially love the cobblestones up front.  Great work all around.', '2005-06-07 23:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439727, 185810, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very compelling shot, nice textures.  The frame is as interesting to me as te object inside.  The only thing I would change is to crop the bottom of the photo in a different spot.  It feels awkward that the rop is cut off right there.</td>', 'Very compelling shot, nice textures.  The frame is as interesting to me as te object inside.  The only thing I would change is to crop the bottom of the photo in a different spot.  It feels awkward that the rop is cut off right there.', '2005-06-08 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439734, 184594, 37103, '<td valign="top">Stunning "natural" frame.  I can almost feel the textures, adorable look on the frog''s face too.</td>', 'Stunning "natural" frame.  I can almost feel the textures, adorable look on the frog''s face too.', '2005-06-08 00:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439735, 185796, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title, gorgeous colors.  It would be nice to have more detail in the wooden frame and the piece of wood extending out on the left is a little distracting.</td>', 'Wonderful title, gorgeous colors.  It would be nice to have more detail in the wooden frame and the piece of wood extending out on the left is a little distracting.', '2005-06-08 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439740, 185871, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow, atheletic model!  Very eye catching.  The man seems reminiscent of the circus, like he part of the acts/show.  I might have preferred is you had a square frame and cut out most of the grass on the bottom.</td>', 'Wow, atheletic model!  Very eye catching.  The man seems reminiscent of the circus, like he part of the acts/show.  I might have preferred is you had a square frame and cut out most of the grass on the bottom.', '2005-06-08 00:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439760, 185777, 37103, '<td valign="top">What a relaxing meditative photo.  Somthing about the soft lines of the woman''s posture and the fact that we''re watching her watching the view is very calming.  I might have like if you cropped out more of the wall on the left side, so the amount of wall shown on both sides was roughly the same.  Love the photo, I don''t know about the title though.</td>', 'What a relaxing meditative photo.  Somthing about the soft lines of the woman''s posture and the fact that we''re watching her watching the view is very calming.  I might have like if you cropped out more of the wall on the left side, so the amount of wall shown on both sides was roughly the same.  Love the photo, I don''t know about the title though.', '2005-06-08 00:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439770, 186041, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate nautical frame for a ship.  I love that we see the texture of the rope.</td>', 'Very appropriate nautical frame for a ship.  I love that we see the texture of the rope.', '2005-06-08 00:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439777, 185779, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great frame, great expression on her face.  You wonder where she is going and what she is thinking.  The photo seems a little dark, but it goes with the mood.</td>', 'Great frame, great expression on her face.  You wonder where she is going and what she is thinking.  The photo seems a little dark, but it goes with the mood.', '2005-06-08 00:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439786, 185058, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment to capture.  You must have waited a long time for this one.  I like the muted colors and the bright yellow of the beaks.  I wish we could see the eye of the mama bird a little more clearly, but don''t know if that would be possible to do.</td>', 'Wonderful moment to capture.  You must have waited a long time for this one.  I like the muted colors and the bright yellow of the beaks.  I wish we could see the eye of the mama bird a little more clearly, but don''t know if that would be possible to do.', '2005-06-08 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1439789, 185807, 37103, '<td valign="top">Wow the detail here is incredible.  Makes mewantto look at the world under a miscroscope.  Definitely let us know what this is when the challenge is over.  Cat?  The out of focus area on the bottom left is a little distracting but the overall impact of the iamge is truly powerful.</td>', 'Wow the detail here is incredible.  Makes mewantto look at the world under a miscroscope.  Definitely let us know what this is when the challenge is over.  Cat?  The out of focus area on the bottom left is a little distracting but the overall impact of the iamge is truly powerful.', '2005-06-08 00:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
