(1442700, 185417, 36141, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to see what it was, but then the air cleared, LOL Like the composition and the B&amp;W 7</td>', 'It took me a while to see what it was, but then the air cleared, LOL Like the composition and the B&W 7', '2005-06-09 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
