(1442717, 185753, 7485, '<td valign="top">Superb colors and lighting! An 8 from me, would be 10 if the crop were shifted up just a bit (loosing the grass at the bottom, including the whole curve at the top)</td>', 'Superb colors and lighting! An 8 from me, would be 10 if the crop were shifted up just a bit (loosing the grass at the bottom, including the whole curve at the top)', '2005-06-09 00:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
