(1443510, 184775, 27901, '<td valign="top">Great setup, this is a mystic face in the green. Might have been better a bit darker the light is a bit to harsh. But this is a neat shot.</td>', 'Great setup, this is a mystic face in the green. Might have been better a bit darker the light is a bit to harsh. But this is a neat shot.', '2005-06-09 11:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
