(1443526, 185264, 27901, '<td valign="top">A bit to bright and the tower not as sharp as I would like to see it, the softening on it doesn''t give it the key on the picture it should hold. I like the texture on the leaves though.</td>', 'A bit to bright and the tower not as sharp as I would like to see it, the softening on it doesn''t give it the key on the picture it should hold. I like the texture on the leaves though.', '2005-06-09 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443527, 185976, 27901, '<td valign="top">This one is definitely framed by itself;-) Sharp colors, the head located so well in the picture. This is well done.</td>', 'This one is definitely framed by itself;-) Sharp colors, the head located so well in the picture. This is well done.', '2005-06-09 11:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443530, 185136, 27901, '<td valign="top">Clear action and clever framing!</td>', 'Clear action and clever framing!', '2005-06-09 11:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443531, 185058, 27901, '<td valign="top">Oh my how did you get this one!!! You have to try again for "Birds" this is a very good shot for it. But for frames it is even better! Love it!</td>', 'Oh my how did you get this one!!! You have to try again for "Birds" this is a very good shot for it. But for frames it is even better! Love it!', '2005-06-09 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443534, 185613, 27901, '<td valign="top">What a lonely face, so cleverly mirrored in the blue pond and both framed by it as well as the trees. There is a bit sharpness missing from the animal and there is something missing although I am not clever enough to point out what it is.</td>', 'What a lonely face, so cleverly mirrored in the blue pond and both framed by it as well as the trees. There is a bit sharpness missing from the animal and there is something missing although I am not clever enough to point out what it is.', '2005-06-09 11:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443535, 186062, 27901, '<td valign="top">Oh my oh my a professional look at the opera. The little bit of the palm tree at the top right irritates a bit but this shot is very good.</td>', 'Oh my oh my a professional look at the opera. The little bit of the palm tree at the top right irritates a bit but this shot is very good.', '2005-06-09 11:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443537, 185901, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is like a painting, what a beautiful scenery! Great shot.</td>', 'This is like a painting, what a beautiful scenery! Great shot.', '2005-06-09 11:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443539, 186020, 27901, '<td valign="top">The youth always creates a beauty, what a beautiful child and it is clever to frame with white stating innocence but at the same time frame with lovely red that indicates life. Great shot.</td>', 'The youth always creates a beauty, what a beautiful child and it is clever to frame with white stating innocence but at the same time frame with lovely red that indicates life. Great shot.', '2005-06-09 11:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443543, 184378, 27886, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.</td>', 'Nice concept.', '2005-06-09 11:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443544, 185968, 27886, '<td valign="top">Frame isn''t 100% but great shot.. 8</td>', 'Frame isn''t 100% but great shot.. 8', '2005-06-09 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443551, 184774, 27886, '<td valign="top">Not too clear of a focal point. 6</td>', 'Not too clear of a focal point. 6', '2005-06-09 11:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443565, 185807, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, went to my favorites right away, Wish I could get my animals to stay put this long;-)</td>', 'This is a great shot, went to my favorites right away, Wish I could get my animals to stay put this long;-)', '2005-06-09 12:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443567, 186073, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dog! great framing, would like to have the dog a bit clear and not the bright spot on the back. The harmony in colors is giving the picture an extra strength.</td>', 'Beautiful dog! great framing, would like to have the dog a bit clear and not the bright spot on the back. The harmony in colors is giving the picture an extra strength.', '2005-06-09 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443568, 185777, 27901, '<td valign="top">Middle age what!?! Beautiful scenery.</td>', 'Middle age what!?! Beautiful scenery.', '2005-06-09 12:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443569, 183752, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, great framing!</td>', 'This is very cute, great framing!', '2005-06-09 12:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443570, 185200, 27901, '<td valign="top">The red is giving this picture extra strength! Great forms and a great shot.</td>', 'The red is giving this picture extra strength! Great forms and a great shot.', '2005-06-09 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443572, 184509, 27901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful;-) The guy should have gone into the frame to make this one absolutely fantastic, but it is great anyway;-)</td>', 'Beautiful;-) The guy should have gone into the frame to make this one absolutely fantastic, but it is great anyway;-)', '2005-06-09 12:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443575, 184899, 27901, '<td valign="top">I love cows, this is a cute picture, might have been a bit darker and sharper but still a good shot.</td>', 'I love cows, this is a cute picture, might have been a bit darker and sharper but still a good shot.', '2005-06-09 12:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443576, 184167, 27901, '<td valign="top">Clever and colorful shot!</td>', 'Clever and colorful shot!', '2005-06-09 12:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443577, 185832, 27901, '<td valign="top">White is always difficult to shoot, so it isn''t easy to see the feathers or the shadows on the bird. Still a good shot.</td>', 'White is always difficult to shoot, so it isn''t easy to see the feathers or the shadows on the bird. Still a good shot.', '2005-06-09 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443583, 183852, 27901, '<td valign="top">Envy you being there, visited Yosemite once, unforgettable experience. Great framing although of course the blue overtakes due to the distance it is in a way rather mythical shot.</td>', 'Envy you being there, visited Yosemite once, unforgettable experience. Great framing although of course the blue overtakes due to the distance it is in a way rather mythical shot.', '2005-06-09 12:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443585, 184245, 27901, '<td valign="top">Yes this is talented photography! You solve the task in an unbelievably clever way, good work!</td>', 'Yes this is talented photography! You solve the task in an unbelievably clever way, good work!', '2005-06-09 12:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443587, 185871, 27901, '<td valign="top">Oh my! This is good!</td>', 'Oh my! This is good!', '2005-06-09 12:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443589, 186041, 27901, '<td valign="top">The colors are beautiful and the framing cleverly done!</td>', 'The colors are beautiful and the framing cleverly done!', '2005-06-09 12:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443590, 185274, 27901, '<td valign="top">This is simply art!</td>', 'This is simply art!', '2005-06-09 12:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443596, 183964, 27901, '<td valign="top">Wow this is a huge cave! I like this shot it is mythical and magnificient at the same time.</td>', 'Wow this is a huge cave! I like this shot it is mythical and magnificient at the same time.', '2005-06-09 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443662, 184006, 29462, '<td valign="top">This is probably a comment you have already seen but the contrast and levels appear so way off I can see the glow from the dodging all around the swans neck and head and even the darkest shadow is only a dark grey not black. I hope this helps you probably need to adjust your monitor</td>', 'This is probably a comment you have already seen but the contrast and levels appear so way off I can see the glow from the dodging all around the swans neck and head and even the darkest shadow is only a dark grey not black. I hope this helps you probably need to adjust your monitor', '2005-06-09 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443720, 185871, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  How cool...  This one certainly stands out in the crowd.  I wasn''t crazy about the sepia tones at first, but they''ve grown on me and now think they add to the image rather than detract.  Nice job.  (10)</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  How cool...  This one certainly stands out in the crowd.  I wasn''t crazy about the sepia tones at first, but they''ve grown on me and now think they add to the image rather than detract.  Nice job.  (10)', '2005-06-09 13:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443724, 186045, 34659, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot!  Very ingenius take on the topic - framing inside a puddle.  Nice job.  (9)</td>', 'Incredible shot!  Very ingenius take on the topic - framing inside a puddle.  Nice job.  (9)', '2005-06-09 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443732, 185413, 19978, '<td valign="top">Lovely! I would have been very tempted to bump the saturation and bring out the blues in the sky and the greens/yellows in the foliage. This could have really been a WOW image, but very nice as is.</td>', 'Lovely! I would have been very tempted to bump the saturation and bring out the blues in the sky and the greens/yellows in the foliage. This could have really been a WOW image, but very nice as is.', '2005-06-09 13:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443736, 185704, 19978, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb. I applaud you for having the vision to "see" this shot and then get it as you did. Wonderful.</td>', 'Absolutely superb. I applaud you for having the vision to "see" this shot and then get it as you did. Wonderful.', '2005-06-09 13:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443737, 185994, 37252, '<td valign="top">could have been composed better. Perhaps if you had been at a better angle, plus shot through the space between railing bars this would score higher. The hand rail is more of a distraction than a help in framing - IMHO</td>', 'could have been composed better. Perhaps if you had been at a better angle, plus shot through the space between railing bars this would score higher. The hand rail is more of a distraction than a help in framing - IMHO', '2005-06-09 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443740, 186074, 19978, '<td valign="top">Looks waaay oversharpened. I don''t really "get" the naturally framed connection either. Not obvious to me. Still, a nice enough pic.</td>', 'Looks waaay oversharpened. I don''t really "get" the naturally framed connection either. Not obvious to me. Still, a nice enough pic.', '2005-06-09 13:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443743, 185828, 24599, '<td valign="top">this is an awesoem photo. if you can adjust (increase) the saturation and maybe a little more contrast, i''d buy a print! (of course thats my taste and opinion, its still a good shot) ALSO please SHARE the information and shot setup as well as location.</td>', 'this is an awesoem photo. if you can adjust (increase) the saturation and maybe a little more contrast, i''d buy a print! (of course thats my taste and opinion, its still a good shot) ALSO please SHARE the information and shot setup as well as location.', '2005-06-09 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1443755, 185778, 19978, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, but the blurred quality of the water isn''t as effective, especially since you''re calling attention to the wave in your title. I like the innovative use of negative space though. I''m not sure if you could have achieved the faster exposure necessary to freeze the water or not. Could have been great. Overall, I like the photo but IMO it lacks the punch it could have had if the wave was sharp and defined.</td>', 'Interesting take, but the blurred quality of the water isn''t as effective, especially since you''re calling attention to the wave in your title. I like the innovative use of negative space though. I''m not sure if you could have achieved the faster exposure necessary to freeze the water or not. Could have been great. Overall, I like the photo but IMO it lacks the punch it could have had if the wave was sharp and defined.', '2005-06-09 14:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
