(1445345, 184509, 32767, '<td valign="top">This would be awesome if your suject (the person I''m guessing,  is the subject??) was inside the frame. I''m also guessing that the crack in the rocks are the frame but maybe the rocks are the frame??? Anyway, I still like it. 7 I''ll need to get back to you on this one in the bumping phase.<br/> <br/>I just read the title. 8</td>', 'This would be awesome if your suject (the person I''m guessing,  is the subject??) was inside the frame. I''m also guessing that the crack in the rocks are the frame but maybe the rocks are the frame??? Anyway, I still like it. 7 I''ll need to get back to you on this one in the bumping phase. I just read the title. 8', '2005-06-10 04:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445349, 186041, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image. One of my favorites so far, one of the few entries with an interesting subject within a great frame. I wonder if you could have lended it more drama with some color or contrast enhamcement??? 8</td>', 'Nice image. One of my favorites so far, one of the few entries with an interesting subject within a great frame. I wonder if you could have lended it more drama with some color or contrast enhamcement??? 8', '2005-06-10 04:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445356, 185871, 34247, '<td valign="top">Seems posed ;-)<br/>Nice shot though, with creative formation process. The colors are nice. The shadow of the flipper is a slight distraction. Probably will end up as one of my higher scores in the challenge. Right now, let''s do an 8, with possible bump. I''ll do it a 10, because it is the most striking image in the challenge for me. Same sky/clouds as Pedro''s horse shot in silhouette...</td>', 'Seems posed ;-)Nice shot though, with creative formation process. The colors are nice. The shadow of the flipper is a slight distraction. Probably will end up as one of my higher scores in the challenge. Right now, let''s do an 8, with possible bump. I''ll do it a 10, because it is the most striking image in the challenge for me. Same sky/clouds as Pedro''s horse shot in silhouette...', '2005-06-10 04:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445359, 186051, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great capture</td>', 'Great capture', '2005-06-10 04:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445361, 185968, 3306, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors. I would love to see another picture with the boat on the lower right a larger part of the frame.</td>', 'beautiful colors. I would love to see another picture with the boat on the lower right a larger part of the frame.', '2005-06-10 04:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445364, 186066, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very similar to my shot. I love the colors. A difficult capture. Great job.</td>', 'Very similar to my shot. I love the colors. A difficult capture. Great job.', '2005-06-10 04:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445365, 185013, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Excellent focus on the subject and the fire.</td>', 'Great capture. Excellent focus on the subject and the fire.', '2005-06-10 04:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445366, 185963, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Great DOF</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Great DOF', '2005-06-10 04:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445369, 185964, 3306, '<td valign="top">Excellent point of view for this picture. Seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Excellent point of view for this picture. Seems a little out of focus.', '2005-06-10 04:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445370, 184167, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good eye. Love the colors.</td>', 'Good eye. Love the colors.', '2005-06-10 04:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445371, 185704, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you did not take this picture straight through the middle. It adds creativity and interest. Good shot.</td>', 'I like the fact that you did not take this picture straight through the middle. It adds creativity and interest. Good shot.', '2005-06-10 04:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445373, 185310, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done. Great angle. Would have done well in the Construction challenge also.</td>', 'Well done. Great angle. Would have done well in the Construction challenge also.', '2005-06-10 04:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445375, 184933, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simple and attractive. Maybe not naturally framed but I like it none the less.</td>', 'Simple and attractive. Maybe not naturally framed but I like it none the less.', '2005-06-10 04:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445376, 185628, 3306, '<td valign="top">This shot has potential. I really  like the rustic nature and colors.</td>', 'This shot has potential. I really  like the rustic nature and colors.', '2005-06-10 04:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445383, 184967, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Love the expression.</td>', 'Nice capture. Love the expression.', '2005-06-10 05:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445396, 185963, 17507, '<td valign="top">a lovely picture, to be sure, worthy of many accolades.. but not for framing. I don''t think this meets the challenge.</td>', 'a lovely picture, to be sure, worthy of many accolades.. but not for framing. I don''t think this meets the challenge.', '2005-06-10 05:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445397, 185625, 36437, '<td valign="top">One of the best! Maybe a ribbon!</td>', 'One of the best! Maybe a ribbon!', '2005-06-10 05:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445400, 185590, 17507, '<td valign="top">in my opinion, the bird would be better placed slightly higher and to the right. nonetheless, this is a nice capture, better than most (7)</td>', 'in my opinion, the bird would be better placed slightly higher and to the right. nonetheless, this is a nice capture, better than most (7)', '2005-06-10 05:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445404, 185303, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the low-key-esque feeling of this. could have used a wee bit more contrast. (7)</td>', 'I like the composition and the low-key-esque feeling of this. could have used a wee bit more contrast. (7)', '2005-06-10 05:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445492, 185743, 30018, '<td valign="top">I generally hate duck and swan pictures, but this one is really quite nice.  Very nicely framed.  Nice composition.  I think it is really nice how the little guys are in swimming in the reflections of the parent.  It''s a very peaceful image; one that would hang very nicely in a doctor''s office, or any office for that matter.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I generally hate duck and swan pictures, but this one is really quite nice.  Very nicely framed.  Nice composition.  I think it is really nice how the little guys are in swimming in the reflections of the parent.  It''s a very peaceful image; one that would hang very nicely in a doctor''s office, or any office for that matter.  <7>', '2005-06-10 07:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445494, 185751, 30018, '<td valign="top">Rough looking tracks, but very nice composition.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Rough looking tracks, but very nice composition.  <7>', '2005-06-10 07:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445498, 186069, 30018, '<td valign="top">Wow...or should I say WOW!  That is quite a shot.  Dramatic is the only word I can think of to describe this shot.  Very powerful image.  Good Title too.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Wow...or should I say WOW!  That is quite a shot.  Dramatic is the only word I can think of to describe this shot.  Very powerful image.  Good Title too.  <7>', '2005-06-10 08:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445509, 185440, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I love greens in this shot, which very nicely compliment the blueish-gray titmouse.  The reds almost create a holiday feeling.  Very nice composition, with wonderful textures and tones.  Might be a ribbon winner!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Very nice image.  I love greens in this shot, which very nicely compliment the blueish-gray titmouse.  The reds almost create a holiday feeling.  Very nice composition, with wonderful textures and tones.  Might be a ribbon winner!  <9>', '2005-06-10 08:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445512, 185179, 30018, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Some really nice textures in the image, as well as detail in the hair and fabrics of the material.  Great contrast in this image, and loving eyes as well.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Cute title.  Some really nice textures in the image, as well as detail in the hair and fabrics of the material.  Great contrast in this image, and loving eyes as well.  <7>', '2005-06-10 08:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445518, 185310, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, baby!  Perfect...!  I love it.  I think using B&amp;W was a great choice on this image.  It''s wonderfully framed, but the picture and the building.  Great title.  Great Image. My favorite in this challenge.  Good Luck, hope you get a Blue Ribbon!  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'This is awesome, baby!  Perfect...!  I love it.  I think using B&W was a great choice on this image.  It''s wonderfully framed, but the picture and the building.  Great title.  Great Image. My favorite in this challenge.  Good Luck, hope you get a Blue Ribbon!  <10>', '2005-06-10 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445580, 185979, 13487, '<td valign="top">Great silohette!!  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-13 21:25:17.</i></td>', 'Great silohette!!  ', '2005-06-10 09:42:20.000000', '2007-11-13 21:25:17.000000', 1),
(1445616, 185675, 11800, '<td valign="top">The exposure is very good and I like the softness of the focus. The lightness and angle of her face make it the central focus of the picture and gives rythym to the picture. The hair hanging down repeats the iris leaf pattern and adds to the dynamic instead of detracting. The only thing that, to me, isn''t perfect is the expression on her face. She doesn''t look  like this is something she likes and it causes some negative emotions within me.</td>', 'The exposure is very good and I like the softness of the focus. The lightness and angle of her face make it the central focus of the picture and gives rythym to the picture. The hair hanging down repeats the iris leaf pattern and adds to the dynamic instead of detracting. The only thing that, to me, isn''t perfect is the expression on her face. She doesn''t look  like this is something she likes and it causes some negative emotions within me.', '2005-06-10 10:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445618, 186009, 28801, '<td valign="top">A little over-exposed for my tastes. I think a slight upward nudge of the saturation could benefit this shot. Nice composition.</td>', 'A little over-exposed for my tastes. I think a slight upward nudge of the saturation could benefit this shot. Nice composition.', '2005-06-10 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445621, 185534, 34759, '<td valign="top">Squirrel''s a bit out of focus. But cute.</td>', 'Squirrel''s a bit out of focus. But cute.', '2005-06-10 10:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445623, 185628, 34759, '<td valign="top">Not the most interesting subject, but I like it. Great textures.</td>', 'Not the most interesting subject, but I like it. Great textures.', '2005-06-10 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445625, 185953, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love this! Great job getting the wasp in midflight.</td>', 'I love this! Great job getting the wasp in midflight.', '2005-06-10 10:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445629, 185968, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are pretty but perhaps a bit oversaturated.  The exposure is ok.  Serene location.  The tree branch might have been included to fit the challenge but looking at the picture, I question if it adds anything to the composition. I keep wishing the canoe was in the picture more.</td>', 'The colors are pretty but perhaps a bit oversaturated.  The exposure is ok.  Serene location.  The tree branch might have been included to fit the challenge but looking at the picture, I question if it adds anything to the composition. I keep wishing the canoe was in the picture more.', '2005-06-10 10:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445631, 185964, 34759, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Looks like it would be a decent shot if it wasn''t.</td>', 'Out of focus. Looks like it would be a decent shot if it wasn''t.', '2005-06-10 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445634, 186020, 28801, '<td valign="top">Sbarp picture and you nailed the white balance!</td>', 'Sbarp picture and you nailed the white balance!', '2005-06-10 10:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445635, 186037, 34759, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot. Very original. I think I would have cropped out some of the dark bottom.. not sure. Nice job!</td>', 'Really cool shot. Very original. I think I would have cropped out some of the dark bottom.. not sure. Nice job!', '2005-06-10 10:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445636, 184559, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I''m not crazy about the selective desaturation in this particular photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I''m not crazy about the selective desaturation in this particular photo.', '2005-06-10 10:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445637, 185179, 28801, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good humour. A diffused light source would improve it further.</td>', 'Nice capture and good humour. A diffused light source would improve it further.', '2005-06-10 10:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445638, 185675, 28801, '<td valign="top">I''m lost for words. It''s beautiful.</td>', 'I''m lost for words. It''s beautiful.', '2005-06-10 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445639, 185753, 34759, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful! Great clouds and colors. Only thing I would have done was crop out a tiny bit from the sides and try to get a little bit more of the framing in the top.</td>', 'Really beautiful! Great clouds and colors. Only thing I would have done was crop out a tiny bit from the sides and try to get a little bit more of the framing in the top.', '2005-06-10 10:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445640, 185139, 11800, '<td valign="top">It fits the challenge. I question if the darker upper branches add to the composition. It is a pleasant scene otherwise.</td>', 'It fits the challenge. I question if the darker upper branches add to the composition. It is a pleasant scene otherwise.', '2005-06-10 10:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445641, 184167, 34759, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I really like this one. I love the different colors of the umbrellas.</td>', 'Great shot, I really like this one. I love the different colors of the umbrellas.', '2005-06-10 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445642, 185976, 34759, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Great detail in his face.</td>', 'Really nice shot. Great detail in his face.', '2005-06-10 10:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445643, 184981, 34759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful waterfall.</td>', 'Beautiful waterfall.', '2005-06-10 10:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445644, 184536, 34759, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The eye is such a pretty color blue!</td>', 'Interesting idea. The eye is such a pretty color blue!', '2005-06-10 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445645, 184594, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. He''s so cute!</td>', 'Nice shot. He''s so cute!', '2005-06-10 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445646, 185270, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like how the red in the wings are repeated in the flower buds. There is a lot of green and one could stretch the meaning of the challenge to say this was a frame but I think you are expecting to much from the viewers.</td>', 'I like how the red in the wings are repeated in the flower buds. There is a lot of green and one could stretch the meaning of the challenge to say this was a frame but I think you are expecting to much from the viewers.', '2005-06-10 10:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445648, 185991, 34759, '<td valign="top">I love this one! It''s one of my favorites in the challenge. I love how the flower seems so out of place and the stange curve of the tree. Great bokeh also.</td>', 'I love this one! It''s one of my favorites in the challenge. I love how the flower seems so out of place and the stange curve of the tree. Great bokeh also.', '2005-06-10 10:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445663, 185084, 34759, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I''m not sure if I would have chosen black and white for this shot. I bet the blue water was very pretty!</td>', 'Pretty. I''m not sure if I would have chosen black and white for this shot. I bet the blue water was very pretty!', '2005-06-10 11:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445664, 185094, 11800, '<td valign="top">The skin is facinating. Almost like there was glitter applied. This fits the challenge. Technically the eye looks cloudy, almost like an older person with cateracts.  I do like this for some reason. Maybe it''s because of the neutral expression?  A square crop would have eliminated any distractions from the eye and created a more forceful statement, imo.</td>', 'The skin is facinating. Almost like there was glitter applied. This fits the challenge. Technically the eye looks cloudy, almost like an older person with cateracts.  I do like this for some reason. Maybe it''s because of the neutral expression?  A square crop would have eliminated any distractions from the eye and created a more forceful statement, imo.', '2005-06-10 11:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445665, 186046, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very harsh sunlight in this one.</td>', 'Very harsh sunlight in this one.', '2005-06-10 11:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445669, 186041, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice. It''s a beautiful ship. I like overcast look it has to it.</td>', 'Nice. It''s a beautiful ship. I like overcast look it has to it.', '2005-06-10 11:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445671, 185647, 34759, '<td valign="top">Cool trees. This looks so much like where I used to live.</td>', 'Cool trees. This looks so much like where I used to live.', '2005-06-10 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1445672, 185454, 34759, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped out the distracting stuff on the left, but it''s a beautiful shot.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped out the distracting stuff on the left, but it''s a beautiful shot.', '2005-06-10 11:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445679, 185597, 34759, '<td valign="top">Could be a great shot, but it looks very oversharpened.</td>', 'Could be a great shot, but it looks very oversharpened.', '2005-06-10 11:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445681, 185413, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Beautiful bridge!</td>', 'Nice shot. Beautiful bridge!', '2005-06-10 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445684, 185762, 34759, '<td valign="top">The eyes a a bit unnatural.</td>', 'The eyes a a bit unnatural.', '2005-06-10 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445685, 185751, 34759, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The crooked tracks make it look kinda spooky!</td>', 'Great shot. The crooked tracks make it look kinda spooky!', '2005-06-10 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445687, 185058, 34759, '<td valign="top">So adorable. Really great shot. I like how the little birds framed by the little hole and the bigger birds framed by the bigger circle. Lots of framing in this one. :)</td>', 'So adorable. Really great shot. I like how the little birds framed by the little hole and the bigger birds framed by the bigger circle. Lots of framing in this one. :)', '2005-06-10 11:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445692, 186054, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think the picture would be stronger without the person. His back is to the viewer and I don''t feel a connection to him at all. The green thing, to me, is the main attraction. I''ve done a perspective correction. See if it helps at all. I think it makes the frame within a frame more appealing to the eyes.<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=187747</td>', 'I think the picture would be stronger without the person. His back is to the viewer and I don''t feel a connection to him at all. The green thing, to me, is the main attraction. I''ve done a perspective correction. See if it helps at all. I think it makes the frame within a frame more appealing to the eyes.//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=187747', '2005-06-10 11:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445701, 185824, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like how you have used dof to create a colorful frame around the central flower. I don''t know if the composition is as interesting as it could have been. Usually a non-centered composition is more dynamic.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like how you have used dof to create a colorful frame around the central flower. I don''t know if the composition is as interesting as it could have been. Usually a non-centered composition is more dynamic.', '2005-06-10 11:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445717, 186062, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually a big fan of branches in the foreground because most people don''t consider if they add or distract from the composition. And most times they distract, imo. But these really add to your composition because they repeat the shapes in the opera house. Thanks. You''ve given a completely new way of viewing a much photographed building.</td>', 'I''m not usually a big fan of branches in the foreground because most people don''t consider if they add or distract from the composition. And most times they distract, imo. But these really add to your composition because they repeat the shapes in the opera house. Thanks. You''ve given a completely new way of viewing a much photographed building.', '2005-06-10 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445726, 185883, 11800, '<td valign="top">The branches make the photo fit the challenge but do they add anything to the composition?</td>', 'The branches make the photo fit the challenge but do they add anything to the composition?', '2005-06-10 11:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445737, 185782, 7543, '<td valign="top">Flott notkun á Sólfarinu, frábærir litir og flott silúetta.</td>', 'Flott notkun á Sólfarinu, frábærir litir og flott silúetta.', '2005-06-10 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445739, 185200, 11800, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and the color. Slick.</td>', 'Love the processing and the color. Slick.', '2005-06-10 11:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445751, 185621, 11800, '<td valign="top">The feathers are the frame. Excellent detail and color on the head. I am missing the cut off part of his beak.</td>', 'The feathers are the frame. Excellent detail and color on the head. I am missing the cut off part of his beak.', '2005-06-10 11:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445755, 185969, 11800, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. I see the cross but it doesn''t mean anything to me without knowing the context.</td>', 'I don''t get it. I see the cross but it doesn''t mean anything to me without knowing the context.', '2005-06-10 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445762, 186051, 11800, '<td valign="top">haha. This makes me feel like a peeping tomasina. I don''t like that feeling so I don''t think the branches add to the image. personal opinion, sorry.</td>', 'haha. This makes me feel like a peeping tomasina. I don''t like that feeling so I don''t think the branches add to the image. personal opinion, sorry.', '2005-06-10 11:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445777, 183964, 11800, '<td valign="top">Had to go reread the challenge. It''s a pretty picture and all but the hole in the ceiling isn''t really framing the subject, is it? I like the picture and will give you a 6, but next time you better follow the instructions! geez</td>', 'Had to go reread the challenge. It''s a pretty picture and all but the hole in the ceiling isn''t really framing the subject, is it? I like the picture and will give you a 6, but next time you better follow the instructions! geez', '2005-06-10 12:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445784, 184774, 39076, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work, it reminds me of what could be a Monet.</td>', 'Beautiful work, it reminds me of what could be a Monet.', '2005-06-10 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445787, 184227, 11800, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite things is geometrics and this is a good photo for repetition. This is more of a pattern picture. The only way to think of this as a frame is to consider each one as it''s own frame and that becomes to much of a task for this viewer.</td>', 'One of my favorite things is geometrics and this is a good photo for repetition. This is more of a pattern picture. The only way to think of this as a frame is to consider each one as it''s own frame and that becomes to much of a task for this viewer.', '2005-06-10 12:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445791, 185858, 15922, '<td valign="top">Great shot - did you have to swim out of the cave? :-)    7</td>', 'Great shot - did you have to swim out of the cave? :-)    7', '2005-06-10 12:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445800, 185905, 15922, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the bright bits are a bit too bright for me. Not sure what you could have done differently though - maybe it''s just a case of adjusting the image with paintshop/photoshop</td>', 'Nice shot, but the bright bits are a bit too bright for me. Not sure what you could have done differently though - maybe it''s just a case of adjusting the image with paintshop/photoshop', '2005-06-10 12:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445801, 185831, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see that some kids can still enjoy the freedom of summer. The one in the water seems to be having a blast. <br/>The composition is weak. The docks on the other side distract and the bridge is cut off at the top. Centered compositions aren''t often very exciting. Moving left or right when setting up the picture can sometimes help to isolate the main subject.</td>', 'It''s good to see that some kids can still enjoy the freedom of summer. The one in the water seems to be having a blast. The composition is weak. The docks on the other side distract and the bridge is cut off at the top. Centered compositions aren''t often very exciting. Moving left or right when setting up the picture can sometimes help to isolate the main subject.', '2005-06-10 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445807, 185201, 15922, '<td valign="top">nice shot - especially as it''s looking towards the camera, but I feel the image has been editted too much. Can''t understand how the grass goes so suddenly from in focus to blurry. Or were you looking throught cracked glass? I had assumed it was leaves making the frame.</td>', 'nice shot - especially as it''s looking towards the camera, but I feel the image has been editted too much. Can''t understand how the grass goes so suddenly from in focus to blurry. Or were you looking throught cracked glass? I had assumed it was leaves making the frame.', '2005-06-10 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1445812, 185274, 11800, '<td valign="top">a very beautiful abstract. I hope this isn''t to subtle for everyone because I''d like to see it way up there in the scores.</td>', 'a very beautiful abstract. I hope this isn''t to subtle for everyone because I''d like to see it way up there in the scores.', '2005-06-10 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
