(1445820, 185631, 15922, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene - well done. Personally I''d prefer it if the tree wasn''t hanging down in the middle, but it''s not a major problem. I suppose next time you could either cut the tree down or crouch down a bit to get it out of the shot :-)   7</td>', 'Lovely scene - well done. Personally I''d prefer it if the tree wasn''t hanging down in the middle, but it''s not a major problem. I suppose next time you could either cut the tree down or crouch down a bit to get it out of the shot :-)   7', '2005-06-10 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
