(1446000, 185248, 18023, '<td valign="top">different pov would have helped this shot. at first i thought the stone was a suitcase and the man was sitting somewhere in the city. the face looks too dark for the rest of his body, as there is details on his arms and legs, but not face. like the saturation though. contrast is good also</td>', 'different pov would have helped this shot. at first i thought the stone was a suitcase and the man was sitting somewhere in the city. the face looks too dark for the rest of his body, as there is details on his arms and legs, but not face. like the saturation though. contrast is good also', '2005-06-10 14:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1446004, 186073, 27789, '<td valign="top">great trees.  the dog looks a little soft, maybe a tiny bit of sharpening would help, and then I would suggest a little dodge and burn in the background to control some of the highlights.  But otherwise a fantastic image.  9.</td>', 'great trees.  the dog looks a little soft, maybe a tiny bit of sharpening would help, and then I would suggest a little dodge and burn in the background to control some of the highlights.  But otherwise a fantastic image.  9.', '2005-06-10 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
