(1446015, 183686, 27789, '<td valign="top">clever concept.  The feet section probably needs to be a lot darker in the floor so the middle x-ray is more apparent, and if the inverse skeleton could have been darker, that would have helped too.  I wonder if using a polarizer to get rid of all window reflections would have helped the photo.  8</td>', 'clever concept.  The feet section probably needs to be a lot darker in the floor so the middle x-ray is more apparent, and if the inverse skeleton could have been darker, that would have helped too.  I wonder if using a polarizer to get rid of all window reflections would have helped the photo.  8', '2005-06-10 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
