(1446775, 186062, 5792, '<td valign="top">An excellent naturally framed image. The iron fence is pretty strait and the way the palms on the right touch the opera house is great. The only minor defect is the lowest palm frond on the left side obscures part of the most interesting part of the building on that side. I would recommend cloning out the part that covers the building on the left sideto to remove it as a distraction. Great picture!</td>', 'An excellent naturally framed image. The iron fence is pretty strait and the way the palms on the right touch the opera house is great. The only minor defect is the lowest palm frond on the left side obscures part of the most interesting part of the building on that side. I would recommend cloning out the part that covers the building on the left sideto to remove it as a distraction. Great picture!', '2005-06-10 21:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
