(1448230, 185704, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2005-06-11 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448235, 185871, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.  The colors and the composition are beautiful, but the acrobat is clearly the star!  What an original interpretation of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.  The colors and the composition are beautiful, but the acrobat is clearly the star!  What an original interpretation of the challenge. 10.', '2005-06-11 21:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448236, 185733, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this one alot.  It''s crisp, the colors are nice.  Definitely feels "natural" to me. I''m giving it a 9.</td>', 'Love this one alot.  It''s crisp, the colors are nice.  Definitely feels "natural" to me. I''m giving it a 9.', '2005-06-11 21:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448237, 185964, 15711, '<td valign="top">The focus should be on the bridge.</td>', 'The focus should be on the bridge.', '2005-06-11 21:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448239, 185672, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet. I''d have like to see it cropped atypically, not just with his nose in the center.  Nicely focused though.</td>', 'Sweet. I''d have like to see it cropped atypically, not just with his nose in the center.  Nicely focused though.', '2005-06-11 21:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448240, 185625, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the subject. I like it very much.  I''ll give you an A for imagination.<br/></td>', 'Interesting take on the subject. I like it very much.  I''ll give you an A for imagination.', '2005-06-11 21:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448308, 185373, 22537, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation as the bells certainly are framed into the tower. On the other side, the clouds are blown out mostly on the top right.  A touch of Sepia may have softened the shot a bit as well. I like the way you decided to compose the shot as it is more creative in layout than alot of the other images in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like your interpretation as the bells certainly are framed into the tower. On the other side, the clouds are blown out mostly on the top right.  A touch of Sepia may have softened the shot a bit as well. I like the way you decided to compose the shot as it is more creative in layout than alot of the other images in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-06-11 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448311, 184378, 22537, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photo and I see where you are attempting to frame the Pepsi can.  Had you isolated the color of your subject and completely desaturated the others, the effect would have had more impact. As is, the other cans though dulled out,  still have enough color to detract from your subject.  Good idea and good luck!</td>', 'A very interesting photo and I see where you are attempting to frame the Pepsi can.  Had you isolated the color of your subject and completely desaturated the others, the effect would have had more impact. As is, the other cans though dulled out,  still have enough color to detract from your subject.  Good idea and good luck!', '2005-06-11 22:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448317, 185087, 22537, '<td valign="top">I will give you this, the shot is crisp, well balanced and well colored.  On the other side, the "framing trees" conceal far too much of the "temple" leaving this image to appear somewhat coincidental and not composed as well as it could have been had you maybe got a little closer and lower. Good luck!</td>', 'I will give you this, the shot is crisp, well balanced and well colored.  On the other side, the "framing trees" conceal far too much of the "temple" leaving this image to appear somewhat coincidental and not composed as well as it could have been had you maybe got a little closer and lower. Good luck!', '2005-06-11 22:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448323, 183852, 22537, '<td valign="top">Beautifil image and I can see the frame.  The colors are great though the distant peaks appear to be hazed out or something reducing their majestic impact.  Maybe a little bit of curves, dodging and burning may have helped to draw out better detail.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautifil image and I can see the frame.  The colors are great though the distant peaks appear to be hazed out or something reducing their majestic impact.  Maybe a little bit of curves, dodging and burning may have helped to draw out better detail.  Good luck!', '2005-06-11 22:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448334, 185344, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image though the bay in itself is somewhat of a boring subject.  Dont get me wrong, I''m sure it is gorgeous but for now, it is just a brown field of sand that happens to be framed.  Too bad there is nothing to make this shot more interesting other than a "pretty bay" at low-tide. Good luck!</td>', 'This is a beautiful image though the bay in itself is somewhat of a boring subject.  Dont get me wrong, I''m sure it is gorgeous but for now, it is just a brown field of sand that happens to be framed.  Too bad there is nothing to make this shot more interesting other than a "pretty bay" at low-tide. Good luck!', '2005-06-11 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1448399, 186041, 23098, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nicely framed and photographed.</td>', 'Beautiful. Nicely framed and photographed.', '2005-06-11 23:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
