(1448479, 185996, 30490, '<td valign="top">In this type of challenge, the subject being framded must be in focus.  The composition of this image means that the greenery on the other side of the tunnel needs to be the main focus.</td>', 'In this type of challenge, the subject being framded must be in focus.  The composition of this image means that the greenery on the other side of the tunnel needs to be the main focus.', '2005-06-12 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
