(1448501, 185672, 30490, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog, I just wish you had wiped the eyes before photographing it,  the matter in the corners is kind of gross.</td>', 'Lovely dog, I just wish you had wiped the eyes before photographing it,  the matter in the corners is kind of gross.', '2005-06-12 00:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
