(1448980, 186045, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very good idea executed with skill and restraint.  The frame and the subject are a harmonious pair, and just enough of each is used to achieve maximum effect.</td>', 'A very good idea executed with skill and restraint.  The frame and the subject are a harmonious pair, and just enough of each is used to achieve maximum effect.', '2005-06-12 11:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
