(1449028, 185248, 30364, '<td valign="top">A deceptively casual image.  Yet a moment''s study reveals that it''s actually an elegant and harmonious composition that succeeds on more than one level; as an interesting &amp; intriguing photograph of its subject; as a pleasing graphic image; and as a very good entry in this challenge.  My only 10.</td>', 'A deceptively casual image.  Yet a moment''s study reveals that it''s actually an elegant and harmonious composition that succeeds on more than one level; as an interesting & intriguing photograph of its subject; as a pleasing graphic image; and as a very good entry in this challenge.  My only 10.', '2005-06-12 11:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449030, 185224, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very skilful photograph; effectively composed and perfectly exposed for maximum effect.</td>', 'This is a very skilful photograph; effectively composed and perfectly exposed for maximum effect.', '2005-06-12 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
