(1449714, 185828, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very creative framing. Like the concept. My only thought is that the subjects that you''re framing are a wee bit small...I almost didn''t notice them at first.</td>', 'Very creative framing. Like the concept. My only thought is that the subjects that you''re framing are a wee bit small...I almost didn''t notice them at first.', '2005-06-12 20:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
