(1449725, 185094, 35804, '<td valign="top">I just really like this...the shimmery skin, the lashes...even those tiny little blood vessels in the eye...the texture of the skin...so nice to see something that hasn''t been de-noised to death...very nice.</td>', 'I just really like this...the shimmery skin, the lashes...even those tiny little blood vessels in the eye...the texture of the skin...so nice to see something that hasn''t been de-noised to death...very nice.', '2005-06-12 20:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449726, 185822, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea to frame the wine and glass with the curves of his face. I like the concept.</td>', 'Very creative idea to frame the wine and glass with the curves of his face. I like the concept.', '2005-06-12 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449729, 185871, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is surely one of my favorites...but I''m not so sure about the BRIGHT orange, I think I would have preferred a more toned down version...buts that''s just me...still an awesome image, really cool.</td>', 'This is surely one of my favorites...but I''m not so sure about the BRIGHT orange, I think I would have preferred a more toned down version...buts that''s just me...still an awesome image, really cool.', '2005-06-12 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449739, 185135, 37730, '<td valign="top">interesting......unusual.....great subject choice.....</td>', 'interesting......unusual.....great subject choice.....', '2005-06-12 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449744, 185789, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great location and shot.  BUT wayyy overprocessed and over saturated.</td>', 'Great location and shot.  BUT wayyy overprocessed and over saturated.', '2005-06-12 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449762, 184973, 25140, '<td valign="top">The siloutte of the person standing is the frame is a nice touch.  This makes you want to enter the park and walk around.  Nice vivid colors and sharpness.  Great work.</td>', 'The siloutte of the person standing is the frame is a nice touch.  This makes you want to enter the park and walk around.  Nice vivid colors and sharpness.  Great work.', '2005-06-12 21:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449766, 185718, 25140, '<td valign="top">Nice work framing your subject.  I like the warm early morning colors, although I might brighten up the blue of the water just for a bit more color.  Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice work framing your subject.  I like the warm early morning colors, although I might brighten up the blue of the water just for a bit more color.  Could be a little sharper.', '2005-06-12 21:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449773, 185037, 25140, '<td valign="top">The b&amp;w really gives your photo a historic feeling.  I like how the lines of your frame (the fence) follow the angles of the farm house.  Just for fun you might try adding a duotone and darken the edges a little.</td>', 'The b&w really gives your photo a historic feeling.  I like how the lines of your frame (the fence) follow the angles of the farm house.  Just for fun you might try adding a duotone and darken the edges a little.', '2005-06-12 21:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449781, 184883, 25140, '<td valign="top">The angle of the bamboo fence really draws your eye into to photo, making it an effective frame.  The lighting and DOF is very nice as this has an almost 3D look to it.  I might like to see the color of the bird a bit more saturated, just to make him stand out a bit more, but I''m not sure.</td>', 'The angle of the bamboo fence really draws your eye into to photo, making it an effective frame.  The lighting and DOF is very nice as this has an almost 3D look to it.  I might like to see the color of the bird a bit more saturated, just to make him stand out a bit more, but I''m not sure.', '2005-06-12 21:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449796, 185924, 25140, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot with great perspective.  I love the blue sky and the frame, but not the purple cast on the wood.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot with great perspective.  I love the blue sky and the frame, but not the purple cast on the wood.', '2005-06-12 21:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449801, 184167, 34341, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2005-06-12 21:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449804, 185753, 25140, '<td valign="top">This shot made me say, wow.  Its really lovely.  Such nice colors and lighting.  It makes me just want to gaze at the sky and be at peace, while surrounded by this amazing old structure.  Great work!</td>', 'This shot made me say, wow.  Its really lovely.  Such nice colors and lighting.  It makes me just want to gaze at the sky and be at peace, while surrounded by this amazing old structure.  Great work!', '2005-06-12 21:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449810, 185995, 25140, '<td valign="top">Great detail.   A beautiful capture.</td>', 'Great detail.   A beautiful capture.', '2005-06-12 21:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449826, 185952, 25140, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Your frame is so subtle and yet  is such an important element in the photo.  You''ve also managed to capture some interesting textures and detail.  The model seems secondary to everything else going on in the picture and that makes this photo work, she completes it.</td>', 'I really like this.  Your frame is so subtle and yet  is such an important element in the photo.  You''ve also managed to capture some interesting textures and detail.  The model seems secondary to everything else going on in the picture and that makes this photo work, she completes it.', '2005-06-12 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449835, 186054, 25140, '<td valign="top">Your frame and sky have a cool industrial feel, making the brightly colored elements seem out of place, that''s a good thing, it makes this photo interesting to look at.  Nice work.</td>', 'Your frame and sky have a cool industrial feel, making the brightly colored elements seem out of place, that''s a good thing, it makes this photo interesting to look at.  Nice work.', '2005-06-12 21:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449858, 185417, 27161, '<td valign="top">I think the border is a little too large and distracting, but I like the framing of the clouds.</td>', 'I think the border is a little too large and distracting, but I like the framing of the clouds.', '2005-06-12 22:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449864, 184381, 4338, '<td valign="top">very nice image. also not sure if you noticed, but there looks like there is a face in the clouds</td>', 'very nice image. also not sure if you noticed, but there looks like there is a face in the clouds', '2005-06-12 22:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1449866, 184933, 27161, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  10</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  10', '2005-06-12 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
