(1449886, 185880, 27161, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve had a lot of success with this subject, but I think you could learn be successful experimenting with other subjects.</td>', 'I know you''ve had a lot of success with this subject, but I think you could learn be successful experimenting with other subjects.', '2005-06-12 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
