(1450057, 185274, 34247, '<td valign="top">Like the toning and textures very much. Subjects looks well aged, the shadow is great. White speck on the shadow is a small issue. 10 still.</td>', 'Like the toning and textures very much. Subjects looks well aged, the shadow is great. White speck on the shadow is a small issue. 10 still.', '2005-06-13 00:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
