(1450063, 185675, 34247, '<td valign="top">Lovely turn in the title. I like the control on the B/W. Personally, would have gone for higher contrast, just a tad. Also might suggest a crop shift, about an inch off the right side, off-centering the face. But this is still a 10 for me for the associations it evokes.</td>', 'Lovely turn in the title. I like the control on the B/W. Personally, would have gone for higher contrast, just a tad. Also might suggest a crop shift, about an inch off the right side, off-centering the face. But this is still a 10 for me for the associations it evokes.', '2005-06-13 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1450066, 186048, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most natural subject. Nothing like the cat in the window. A little more clarity would have helped bet then black subjects are never easy specially at a distance. Bumping up.</td>', 'A most natural subject. Nothing like the cat in the window. A little more clarity would have helped bet then black subjects are never easy specially at a distance. Bumping up.', '2005-06-13 00:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
