(1450740, 185871, 93, '<td valign="top">That damn London Eye.. <br/> <br/>When I saw this, I said to myself, "that''s a sure-fire ribboner".  I didn''t say "blue".. but I had a feeling.<br/> <br/>It''s too bad I can only recognize ribbon winners when I see them in a challenge.. not when I shoot them myself.</td>', 'That damn London Eye..  When I saw this, I said to myself, "that''s a sure-fire ribboner".  I didn''t say "blue".. but I had a feeling. It''s too bad I can only recognize ribbon winners when I see them in a challenge.. not when I shoot them myself.', '2005-06-13 03:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
