(1450747, 184967, 18450, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! Colours are lovely, excellent focus and the expression on her face is delightful. Underrated in this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!! Colours are lovely, excellent focus and the expression on her face is delightful. Underrated in this challenge.', '2005-06-13 04:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1450757, 186041, 31307, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone who commented and those who were supportive of this amateur attempt to show the beauty of tall ships.  When I saw my score during the challenge, I was ecstatic: I had shattered my old PR by nearly a whole point!  I figured I''d be in the top 10 percent maybe.  The yellow is a very pleasant surprise!  The sad part is now that I have ribboned, it will be at least a year, I imagine, before I ribbon again!  Also, a couple of months from now, when my post-processing skill have improved (the Oregon GTG was phenomenal in helping me develop [pun intended] both and post-processing and photography skills) I will look back at this picture and see a million ways to have improved it, lol!</td>', 'Thanks everyone who commented and those who were supportive of this amateur attempt to show the beauty of tall ships.  When I saw my score during the challenge, I was ecstatic: I had shattered my old PR by nearly a whole point!  I figured I''d be in the top 10 percent maybe.  The yellow is a very pleasant surprise!  The sad part is now that I have ribboned, it will be at least a year, I imagine, before I ribbon again!  Also, a couple of months from now, when my post-processing skill have improved (the Oregon GTG was phenomenal in helping me develop [pun intended] both and post-processing and photography skills) I will look back at this picture and see a million ways to have improved it, lol!', '2005-06-13 04:37:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1450758, 185871, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Jon.<br/>Good capture and splendid PP.</td>', 'Congratulations Jon.Good capture and splendid PP.', '2005-06-13 04:40:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1450759, 184167, 37430, '<td valign="top">Amazing pic. Congratulation on great score! It reminds me of my visit to SanAntonio four years back. Well captured. I''d have given 10 on this.</td>', 'Amazing pic. Congratulation on great score! It reminds me of my visit to SanAntonio four years back. Well captured. I''d have given 10 on this.', '2005-06-13 04:46:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1450761, 185753, 16636, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes, very much appreciated.<br/> <br/>How typical; the images that I have done best with on DPC have all been taken without the knowledge of the weekly challenge title! I took this image on a Monday evening and it was only when returning home that I discovered the challenge was ''framed''.<br/> <br/>This is Chesterton Windmill in Warwickshire, last known working was in 1910..<br/> <br/>Some other images i took on a magical evening.....<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189157" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189157.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189157.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189157.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189158" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189158.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189158.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189158.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189160" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189160.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189160.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189160.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189159" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189159.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189159.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16636/thumb/189159.jpg"/></a> <a href="/