(1451274, 184967, 19333, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, sure, but it isn''t what I see as "naturally framed" but more like "artificially framed". I think you used a little too munch Neat, as the face looks too "plastic" to me. I don''t mean OOF or soft focus, as the hair is sharp, but texture less.</td>', 'Nice portrait, sure, but it isn''t what I see as "naturally framed" but more like "artificially framed". I think you used a little too munch Neat, as the face looks too "plastic" to me. I don''t mean OOF or soft focus, as the hair is sharp, but texture less.', '2005-06-13 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451288, 185569, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, and if anything, I feel this shot could have been enhanced by bumping contrast and creating a starker, toned look. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189202" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34247/thumb/189202.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34247/thumb/189202.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/34247/thumb/189202.jpg"/></a>. Took liberties, hope you''re not offended.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-13 08:18:00.</i></td>', 'I like the shadow, and if anything, I feel this shot could have been enhanced by bumping contrast and creating a starker, toned look. . Took liberties, hope you''re not offended.', '2005-06-13 09:15:01.000000', '2005-06-13 09:18:00.000000', 0),
(1451345, 185871, 3087, '<td valign="top">I wondered if this was one of yours when I saw it!<br/>Congrats!</td>', 'I wondered if this was one of yours when I saw it!Congrats!', '2005-06-13 09:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451369, 185507, 23458, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pedxer:</b></div><hr/><i> Really good job, but I think your timing is bad.  Don''t you think voters are still going to be recovering from the apple challenge?  Thats like telling a airplane joke on September 13 2001. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Look more like nectarines to me...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Pedxer: Really good job, but I think your timing is bad.  Don''t you think voters are still going to be recovering from the apple challenge?  Thats like telling a airplane joke on September 13 2001.   Look more like nectarines to me... ', '2005-06-13 09:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
