(1451435, 185625, 30817, '<td valign="top">This MIGHT be a case of a rambling, confusing title affecting its value in the mind of the viewer. Usually the more complex the photo, the simpler the title; is a good guideline. Maybe just calling it "4" and letting the viewer use their imagination to sort it all out, would have been more prudent. That said, this is an exceptionally fine photograph no matter the title. My comments above only apply to competitive scoring situations.</td>', 'This MIGHT be a case of a rambling, confusing title affecting its value in the mind of the viewer. Usually the more complex the photo, the simpler the title; is a good guideline. Maybe just calling it "4" and letting the viewer use their imagination to sort it all out, would have been more prudent. That said, this is an exceptionally fine photograph no matter the title. My comments above only apply to competitive scoring situations.', '2005-06-13 10:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451465, 185675, 37544, '<td valign="top">Thank You! Thank You! Thank You for all the great comments during and after voting! I was so excited during the challenge and was very hopeful for a ribbon.  I didn''t get one, but this is the best I have ever done on this website.  It is soooo hard competing with you guys! Everyone here is sooooo talented and creative, it makes me push the envelope a little and try as hard as I can to get better and better. I WILL GET A RIBBON ONE DAY!!  I am certain! I may have to be a member for 5 years first though, but I will get one I just know it.  THis just wasn''t the right time.</td>', 'Thank You! Thank You! Thank You for all the great comments during and after voting! I was so excited during the challenge and was very hopeful for a ribbon.  I didn''t get one, but this is the best I have ever done on this website.  It is soooo hard competing with you guys! Everyone here is sooooo talented and creative, it makes me push the envelope a little and try as hard as I can to get better and better. I WILL GET A RIBBON ONE DAY!!  I am certain! I may have to be a member for 5 years first though, but I will get one I just know it.  THis just wasn''t the right time.', '2005-06-13 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
