(1451768, 185673, 25024, '<td valign="top">I dont know what happened but somewhere along the way your computer gave me a whole point more than I expected or probably deserve but, I aint complaining, anyway thanks to everyone for all your supportive comments and votes. <br/>I think weve found the lunatic climber havent we Falc! <br/>I agree about the width of the crop but there were climbing ropes in the right hand wall that I could have cloned out but I prefer to leave cloning to the absolute minimum. <br/>Thanks again folks, your support and constructive feedback are inspiring and very gratefully acknowledged. <br/></td>', 'I dont know what happened but somewhere along the way your computer gave me a whole point more than I expected or probably deserve but, I aint complaining, anyway thanks to everyone for all your supportive comments and votes. I think weve found the lunatic climber havent we Falc! I agree about the width of the crop but there were climbing ropes in the right hand wall that I could have cloned out but I prefer to leave cloning to the absolute minimum. Thanks again folks, your support and constructive feedback are inspiring and very gratefully acknowledged. ', '2005-06-13 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451815, 185871, 37875, '<td valign="top">wow!  congrats on the win!  love the energy and choice of subject!</td>', 'wow!  congrats on the win!  love the energy and choice of subject!', '2005-06-13 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451820, 185753, 37875, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful picture...i love the contrast between stone, land, and sky...it''s magical.  congrats on the ribbon!  : )</td>', 'what a beautiful picture...i love the contrast between stone, land, and sky...it''s magical.  congrats on the ribbon!  : )', '2005-06-13 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451827, 186041, 37875, '<td valign="top">i appreciate the freshness and balance of this picture.  i particularly like how the riggings from another ship provide the framing for the subject.  congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'i appreciate the freshness and balance of this picture.  i particularly like how the riggings from another ship provide the framing for the subject.  congrats on the ribbon!', '2005-06-13 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451840, 185753, 37395, '<td valign="top">amaizing... congrats... the colors, the view... I dont have words...</td>', 'amaizing... congrats... the colors, the view... I dont have words...', '2005-06-13 12:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1451880, 186041, 24454, '<td valign="top">WHAT an awesome shot!   I love it when people win their well-deserved first ribbons!   Congratulations!!!!<br/> <br/>SandyP</td>', 'WHAT an awesome shot!   I love it when people win their well-deserved first ribbons!   Congratulations!!!! SandyP', '2005-06-13 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 0),
