(1451901, 185310, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m so surprised this did not finish much higher.  Excellent shot, with great photographic tecniques.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I''m so surprised this did not finish much higher.  Excellent shot, with great photographic tecniques.  Very nicely done!', '2005-06-13 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452017, 185493, 12448, '<td valign="top">Read your comments in the thread and the comments here are right on with the post processing.  You need to control the post processing and not use the Auto anything.  That way you can see it bit by bit as it adjusts.  I went to a workshop a couple of months ago and the gentleman that taught the session I was in said, "AUTO ANYTHING IS EVIL!!!  NEVER TOUCH IT!!!"  Also, never touch brightness and contrast, make all your adjustments in levels and curves. :O)<br/> <br/>Deannda<br/>It''s a beautiful shot</td>', 'Read your comments in the thread and the comments here are right on with the post processing.  You need to control the post processing and not use the Auto anything.  That way you can see it bit by bit as it adjusts.  I went to a workshop a couple of months ago and the gentleman that taught the session I was in said, "AUTO ANYTHING IS EVIL!!!  NEVER TOUCH IT!!!"  Also, never touch brightness and contrast, make all your adjustments in levels and curves. :O) DeanndaIt''s a beautiful shot', '2005-06-13 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452087, 185871, 19672, '<td valign="top">WOW....</td>', 'WOW....', '2005-06-13 14:00:27.000000', NULL, 0),
