(1452820, 185184, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the right on comments.  I knew the shot was too overexposed on the back/wings.  I should have cropped it to address the head more.  Was seeing if my thoughts were similar and they were.  The "poop" was a spiderweb, didn''t this it was that that much of a distractant, maybe it was.  Van</td>', 'Thanks for the right on comments.  I knew the shot was too overexposed on the back/wings.  I should have cropped it to address the head more.  Was seeing if my thoughts were similar and they were.  The "poop" was a spiderweb, didn''t this it was that that much of a distractant, maybe it was.  Van', '2005-06-13 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 0),
