(1452940, 185675, 16241, '<td valign="top">beautiful, good idea to go with black/white</td>', 'beautiful, good idea to go with black/white', '2005-06-13 18:51:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452943, 185871, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for the warming comments. The 115 mentions here amount to a fair bit of time spent looking at this, so it does mean a lot to me (the best element of this site are, as ever, the written thoughts).<br/> <br/>For the record, I was in two minds about the toning, but I did want something warm, radiant and eye-catching that reflected the energy of these amazingly supple gymnasts. They were all amateurs ''off the street'' and thoroughly nice guys too. The photo does look quite busy at this size but I can tell you that the full size version is oozing with detail and little facets of interest. Here''s a detail from the print:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189401" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/189401.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/189401.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/8860/thumb/189401.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Thanks again.<br/>Jon</td>', 'Thanks so much for the warming comments. The 115 mentions here amount to a fair bit of time spent looking at this, so it does mean a lot to me (the best element of this site are, as ever, the written thoughts). For the record, I was in two minds about the toning, but I did want something warm, radiant and eye-catching that reflected the energy of these amazingly supple gymnasts. They were all amateurs ''off the street'' and thoroughly nice guys too. The photo does look quite busy at this size but I can tell you that the full size version is oozing with detail and little facets of interest. Here''s a detail from the print:  Thanks again.Jon', '2005-06-13 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452962, 185871, 6306, '<td valign="top">You certainly live up to your username. Congratulations. This reminds me of work by Henri Cartier-Bresson.  One gripe I have is the tone of the image. It looks too much like a coffee stain.  I wish it was a lighter tone. Other than that, this is excellent.<br/></td>', 'You certainly live up to your username. Congratulations. This reminds me of work by Henri Cartier-Bresson.  One gripe I have is the tone of the image. It looks too much like a coffee stain.  I wish it was a lighter tone. Other than that, this is excellent.', '2005-06-13 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1452990, 185871, 10818, '<td valign="top">Congrats Jon !  That is just an awesome photo. Such warm and rich tones.  Of all your wonderful ribbon winners, this one is my favorite.</td>', 'Congrats Jon !  That is just an awesome photo. Such warm and rich tones.  Of all your wonderful ribbon winners, this one is my favorite.', '2005-06-13 19:18:08.000000', NULL, 0),
