(1453026, 185871, 30392, '<td valign="top">Ah dude, you are good. It''s funny, but when I read Xion''s post in the "frame" score thread saying his average was 10 after 8 votes with 2 faves and 1 wish list (if I remember right) I believed it (cuz Xion is good too!) and I went searching for his photo through the thumbnails and I immediately knew it HAD to be the orange one with the upside down dude...</td>', 'Ah dude, you are good. It''s funny, but when I read Xion''s post in the "frame" score thread saying his average was 10 after 8 votes with 2 faves and 1 wish list (if I remember right) I believed it (cuz Xion is good too!) and I went searching for his photo through the thumbnails and I immediately knew it HAD to be the orange one with the upside down dude...', '2005-06-13 19:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
