(1454764, 185753, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot..you`ve worked well on getting exposure right in all the areas of the image without it looking unnatural.<br/>Congratulations.</td>', 'Lovely shot..you`ve worked well on getting exposure right in all the areas of the image without it looking unnatural.Congratulations.', '2005-06-14 12:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1454817, 185556, 3548, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and couldn''t figure out why it didn''t quite work and/or place higher. I think it may have had to do with the aspect ratio you chose to use. It seems to be close to a 4x5 (8x10) frame but not quite. I would suggest trying it either as a 5x7 or 4x6 and thus eliminating  the slightly  too overwhelming darkness of the "natural frame" of the buildings to what is a powerful and dramatic composition.<br/> <br/>Otherwise, to my eye, a very lovely image!</td>', 'I love this shot and couldn''t figure out why it didn''t quite work and/or place higher. I think it may have had to do with the aspect ratio you chose to use. It seems to be close to a 4x5 (8x10) frame but not quite. I would suggest trying it either as a 5x7 or 4x6 and thus eliminating  the slightly  too overwhelming darkness of the "natural frame" of the buildings to what is a powerful and dramatic composition. Otherwise, to my eye, a very lovely image!', '2005-06-14 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1454896, 186041, 35444, '<td valign="top">This picture has me all tied up in knots!  I LOVE it!</td>', 'This picture has me all tied up in knots!  I LOVE it!', '2005-06-14 13:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
