(1455265, 184967, 31443, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth now afterwards, this is a beautiful photo and framed oh yes! Very good use of fill in flash. Didn''t vote on all the images in the challenge due to connection problems but would have voted high on this image because I love character and expression and this one sure has all of that...</td>', 'For what it''s worth now afterwards, this is a beautiful photo and framed oh yes! Very good use of fill in flash. Didn''t vote on all the images in the challenge due to connection problems but would have voted high on this image because I love character and expression and this one sure has all of that...', '2005-06-14 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
