(1476650, 185556, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I would also crop a little differently to cut out some of the blackness..just a bit.  I think it also seems like it needs the tiniest bit of counter-clockwise rotation.  Very well seen and good idea for the challenge.  It turned out nicely just the way it is.</td>', 'This is really nice.  I would also crop a little differently to cut out some of the blackness..just a bit.  I think it also seems like it needs the tiniest bit of counter-clockwise rotation.  Very well seen and good idea for the challenge.  It turned out nicely just the way it is.', '2005-06-22 20:32:24.000000', NULL, 0),
