(1486553, 185275, 13688, '<td valign="top">i wouldn''t be afraid to up your contrast a bunch more.  i hope you continue to learn psp.  i feel bringing the trees to black and upping the contrast on the boat through dodging and burning so you really highlight the light you have on the bow, would really make this shot catch people''s attention.</td>', 'i wouldn''t be afraid to up your contrast a bunch more.  i hope you continue to learn psp.  i feel bringing the trees to black and upping the contrast on the boat through dodging and burning so you really highlight the light you have on the bow, would really make this shot catch people''s attention.', '2005-06-27 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
