(1564880, 183843, 8009, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity and the skin tones you''ve achieved. Too bad there isn''t more of a catch light in the eye, but I guess that would be difficult behind what''s left of the glasses. Using a flash to create a catch light would probably interfere with the already perfect lighting on the face.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this challenge, but your photo certainly deserved a higher score. Excellent idea for "naturally framed".<br/></td>', 'I love the clarity and the skin tones you''ve achieved. Too bad there isn''t more of a catch light in the eye, but I guess that would be difficult behind what''s left of the glasses. Using a flash to create a catch light would probably interfere with the already perfect lighting on the face. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but your photo certainly deserved a higher score. Excellent idea for "naturally framed".', '2005-07-26 20:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
