(1600007, 186041, 31307, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by herculesksp:</b></div><hr/><i> Firstly, swell shot. Awesome collectors item.<br/>Secondly, where in the world can you ride on those yachts. That would be my dream vacation. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You can ride on some tall ships my visiting their websites and pursuing it that way.  This is a shot of the schooner "The Lady Washington" and was taken from the deck of theprivateer "Lynx."  I do not know about the Lady Washington, but the Lynx offers summer cruises to Hawaii.  Personally, I want to do something like that but I found a group in England that does a several month full eduaction program starting with classroom education and then moving on to drydock refitting and actual sailing time.</td>', 'Originally posted by herculesksp: Firstly, swell shot. Awesome collectors item.Secondly, where in the world can you ride on those yachts. That would be my dream vacation.   You can ride on some tall ships my visiting their websites and pursuing it that way.  This is a shot of the schooner "The Lady Washington" and was taken from the deck of theprivateer "Lynx."  I do not know about the Lady Washington, but the Lynx offers summer cruises to Hawaii.  Personally, I want to do something like that but I found a group in England that does a several month full eduaction program starting with classroom education and then moving on to drydock refitting and actual sailing time.', '2005-08-10 04:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627734, 184167, 18932, '<td valign="top">This looks fantastic - the frame is definitely a strong point and the different coloured umbrellas are great. The people dining are a slight distraction, not sure why, but this is a cool one anyway. I like the stone texture too.</td>', 'This looks fantastic - the frame is definitely a strong point and the different coloured umbrellas are great. The people dining are a slight distraction, not sure why, but this is a cool one anyway. I like the stone texture too.', '2005-08-21 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1637350, 185948, 34659, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Love the idea and composition.  The selective desat works very well too.  The image is a tad grainy and the uppermost left portion is a bit blown out.  Otherwise, superb job.  :-)  I liked the creativity you showed in this entry.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Love the idea and composition.  The selective desat works very well too.  The image is a tad grainy and the uppermost left portion is a bit blown out.  Otherwise, superb job.  :-)  I liked the creativity you showed in this entry.', '2005-08-23 23:37:15.000000', NULL, 0),
