(1659158, 185704, 34659, '<td valign="top">I remember this very well from the challenge - thought it was great then too.  My only minor complaint is that the horizon is horizontal (it''s off just a tad) and given the composition and artistic nature, I think it should be.  Just my opinion, but the image stands strong as is (I scored it an 8).</td>', 'I remember this very well from the challenge - thought it was great then too.  My only minor complaint is that the horizon is horizontal (it''s off just a tad) and given the composition and artistic nature, I think it should be.  Just my opinion, but the image stands strong as is (I scored it an 8).', '2005-08-30 20:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
