(1881472, 185557, 41066, '<td valign="top">This photo has the potential to be a really awesome photograph.  I love how the greenery frames the shot of the building, however I would prefer to see the central focus (the building) more in focus than the outside of the shot.  I think it fits the challenge perfectly.  The only other thing I would do is maybe adjust your curves and levels a bit to give it the "pow" that would really make this shot magical.  I look forward to seeing more shots from you.</td>', 'This photo has the potential to be a really awesome photograph.  I love how the greenery frames the shot of the building, however I would prefer to see the central focus (the building) more in focus than the outside of the shot.  I think it fits the challenge perfectly.  The only other thing I would do is maybe adjust your curves and levels a bit to give it the "pow" that would really make this shot magical.  I look forward to seeing more shots from you.', '2005-11-18 22:05:40.000000', NULL, 0),
